    ### 論壇（發文、留言要先在 auth.http 執行「登入」）

### 文章列表（不用登入）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts

### 只看標記 2330 的文章
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?stockId=2330

### 發文
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "台積電法說會心得",
  "content": "營收比預期好，毛利率維持高檔。\n\n大家怎麼看？",
  "stockIds": ["2330"]
}

> {% if (response.status === 201) { client.global.set("postId", response.body.id); } %}

### 文章內頁（不用登入；有登入會多回傳能不能修改）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}

### 留言
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "同意，下季應該也不錯" }

> {% if (response.status === 201) { client.global.set("commentId", response.body.comments[response.body.comments.length - 1].id); } %}

### 刪除留言
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 修改文章
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "台積電法說會心得（更新）",
  "content": "補充：資本支出也上修了。",
  "stockIds": ["2330", "0050"]
}

### 沒登入發文：應該回 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "t", "content": "c" }

### 刪除文章
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
